 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["n", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "38fe1bd2-f77e-49aa-a78e-34ceb62ee4d1"],
 "}] gives the desired PN expanded amplitude. Possible values for ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["sol", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "fc31bff1-f244-4753-bda9-8ae935aeb9dd"],
 " are as follows: A+, A-, Btrans, Binc, Bref, Ctrans, Cinc, Cref, K\[Nu], K-\
\[Nu]-1, K, W, and PhaseShift"
}], "Usage",
